WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:01.200
What's up guys!

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.040
We are Pongfinity

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:04.820
For this challenge episode we took your ideas from Instagram

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:07.060
and we literally got thousands of requests

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:08.280
Let's see what we got!

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:16.040
It's time to tie these two together

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:45.880
There is 70% of you guys who still haven't subscribed

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:47.380
so remember to do that now!

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:10.700
Gotta move!

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:12.360
I don't like this at all!

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:31.840
That hurt!

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:33.920
Felt like my hand came off!

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:37.040
Let's try to play with chopsticks

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:50.460
Ooh three in a row!

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:51.660
Now you're gonna miss

00:01:58.520 --> 00:01:59.400
Three tries

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:15.600
This is good practice for when I'm going to
eat Chinese food next

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:17.300
I'm just gonna be there like...

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:20.480
Can you pass me the salt? Thanks!

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:23.800
Let's go for the double around the net

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:33.160
That's just where you're aiming for!

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:44.300
Let's try out the triangle ball

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:48.780
This seems like an interesting idea!

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:51.780
Well let's see how many shots we can get

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:55.360
Maybe three. One for each ball!

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:00.920
Roller!

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:12.680
What a serve!

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:14.120
That is a good serve

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:20.140
I can't believe the ball didn't break!

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:30.780
That was a cool idea but it didn't
really quite work out as we were hoping

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:32.040
No it didn't

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:33.540
But remember to subscribe

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:35.520
and watch our previous episodes there

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:39.180
Until next time!

